                        "glosses": [
                            "A transliteration of the Ancient Greek male given name Ἀλκιβιάδης (Alkibiádēs), notably borne by Alcibiades (450–404 B.C.), a prominent Athenian statesman, orator, and general."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
