                                "sense_id": "0b15c9ef-393f-3fc4-b941-8cd30e7dd81b",
                                "text": "Alcibiades was a happy union of coxcomb and conqueror; but there was in him a want of that repose, and of that superb self-reliance, which characterises the Roman."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
